                  É o equipamento de <strong>menor porte/custo</strong> que atende simultaneamente aos <strong>{{ formatMbps(activeSiteEvaluation.requiredBandwidthMbps) }}</strong> de Threat Protection (suporta até {{ formatMbps(activeSiteEvaluation.recommendedBox.threatProtectionMbps) }}), comporta os <strong>{{ activeSiteEvaluation.totalUsersWithGrowth }} usuários projetados</strong> dentro do limite de <strong>{{ activeSiteEvaluation.recommendedBox.ramGb }} GB de RAM</strong> (máx {{ activeSiteEvaluation.recommendedBox.maxUsersByRam }}) e entrega <strong>{{ activeSiteEvaluation.recommendedBox.totalConfigurablePorts }} portas físicas</strong> para as {{ activeSiteEvaluation.totalRequiredPorts }} exigidas.
                </p>
              </div>

